Fix the race condition below. Two concurrent requests can approve the same invoice and overdraw the paid amount.

```php
public function approve(Invoice $invoice)
{
    $invoice->update(['status' => 'approved']);

    $invoice->payments()->create([
        'amount' => $invoice->total,
        'status' => 'paid',
    ]);
}
```

Current behavior: concurrent approve calls create duplicate approved payments and corrupt totals.

Return only the minimal fix needed.
